n $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{y^{2}}{x}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{5}{2})$,$(- \\frac{5}{2},- \\frac{7}{2})$,$(\\frac{7}{2},- \\frac{3}{2})$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{5}{2})}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^{2}}{\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{\\frac{25}{4}}{\\frac{3}{2}}=\\frac{25}{8}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(- \\frac{5}{2},- \\frac{7}{2})}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{\\left(- \\frac{7}{2}\\right)^{2}}{\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{\\frac{49}{4}}{- \\frac{5}{2}}=- \\frac{147}{40}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{7}{2},- \\frac{3}{2})}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)^{2}}{\\left(\\frac{7}{2}\\right)}=\\frac{3}{4}\\frac{\\frac{9}{4}}{\\frac{7}{2}}=\\frac{27}{56}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/9d/9ddc3615a868cd3a04cdf8cbfa2ba3b6bc640cc48708c858442b9dfe3d28a8fc.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526323 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08c0cd85-2156-5d94-ad33-4398f70d01dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/55/55ecce022fd0831df8da1fc1f61f1fa4e026a44045cda95972da5d90c92fb9f5.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526302} {:answer/id #uuid "20490b0a-fd14-554e-ade2-63c10b011887" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8a/8a75b01ca6c1c2e1b2bc1662d3c5a4bb27b3786a1fbb45ce3ed5b75753d08786.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526310} {:answer/id #uuid "c4f1412a-9959-5366-a21b-26431ec32994" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b8/b8816b75d4f579e8afe826676f95c81d5665da65bf2130af4ac5de36d4d4698c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526350} {:answer/id #uuid "d698f143-f53c-5289-9058-446cd4c721cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/30/302037ccb45075f9fa4993fc1848e5b7eddf99025fac6397a628f70de326d1b7.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526357} {:answer/id #uuid "fee01309-0bca-5edf-bfa7-7d78057f4ba1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6c/6c35d6f84b2b5f77763db67efbbe4ec7f6b562404b64695dd79e609bfa749f61.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20490b0a-fd14-554e-ade2-63c10b011887" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8a/8a75b01ca6c1c2e1b2bc1662d3c5a4bb27b3786a1fbb45ce3ed5b75753d08786.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526310} :answer-field/id #uuid "3fcf524a-9ad2-51b4-8e58-b8aee8a8dcc0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526322}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "4182d062-25a8-5f92-8045-b24160f9d484" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{y^{2}}{x}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(1,1)$,$(-2,3)$,$(3,2)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(1,1)}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{(1)^{2}}{(1)}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{1}{1}=\\frac{5}{2}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,3)}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{(3)^{2}}{(-2)}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{9}{-2}=- \\frac{45}{4}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(3,2)}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{(2)^{2}}{(3)}=\\frac{5}{2}\\frac{4}{3}=\\frac{10}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/8a/8a75b01ca6c1c2e1b2bc1662d3c5a4bb27b3786a1fbb45ce3ed5b75753d08786.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526326 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "23fe7e43-97ab-5f45-bc47-5b7a88d09af3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/04/04aa1473811310d1c0c30e8114445c5c78731ec15554054290ed3e0a3c247a03.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526312} {:answer/id #uuid "35cec3ae-127a-5fde-a7fe-3886c3819a97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/4c/4c6fbf5abc1312f4574f42514d2bca4d8edd79583c16f2ecbd25e563f564cdc9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526318} {:answer/id #uuid "b619faf0-5e77-55a8-8b2f-5c9f372b11a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/14/14550d04f27f49653eb9ca0d375c2d0ccce5cf71d70748733dad3a8c7833f43b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526347} {:answer/id #uuid "d47e7d62-dab1-5ec4-8909-258332d048b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/31/31b0758077d503234c2fb48200aff6f57766d52c69a70b23f953f29837cf08d3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526356} {:answer/id #uuid "fbc2f2d0-9273-5e0d-8ef5-f44a93696351" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1e/1ebf12d9e6a0101dfc0c00ca8329aa58e28a6b3c4005bb38ab3014d4ca460c46.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526365}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fbc2f2d0-9273-5e0d-8ef5-f44a93696351" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1e/1ebf12d9e6a0101dfc0c00ca8329aa58e28a6b3c4005bb38ab3014d4ca460c46.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526365} :answer-field/id #uuid "c8d0f568-2e09-533e-b923-117952701d4d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526351}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "4bc469dd-89cc-5c92-9605-097b7ace826d" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}x^{2}-(-2)y^{2}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(2,1)$,$(-2,-2)$,$(-3,-3)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(2,1)}=\\frac{1}{2}(2)^{2}-(-2)(1)^{2}=2-(-2)=4, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,-2)}=\\frac{1}{2}(-2)^{2}-(-2)(-2)^{2}=2-(-8)=10, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-3,-3)}=\\frac{1}{2}(-3)^{2}-(-2)(-3)^{2}=\\frac{9}{2}-(-18)=\\frac{45}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/1e/1ebf12d9e6a0101dfc0c00ca8329aa58e28a6b3c4005bb38ab3014d4ca460c46.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526329 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "002443df-175c-5f3c-916c-31c54a130e23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/82/82f1453d9f38011d775803d700ae331f238c861564eeac4f3201ccf77b4c67b9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526298} {:answer/id #uuid "1e24712f-ed6c-5421-a806-f628b23f4b22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/08/0822ae8783ee9c8c8743ecade2d6404c868d32cc60a2f15fb1d7ba102da88523.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526308} {:answer/id #uuid "37443dec-b9c0-5d52-901a-5b71d9f9cbe7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7e/7e9b6daec155cf70a743578ce561fda017d20ab6955af3fa3a0ddf599542de29.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526320} {:answer/id #uuid "d12b791e-1710-5dba-ace1-adccc5904bb1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/55/5561f44cbaeaf6bc79d5df8360b85d3b2dc4025bf3eda30677b6ae9bb4c3f14e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526353} {:answer/id #uuid "d18a33ec-6c1d-5f1c-9f87-3be112ecf40d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8b/8b5c3eec9e38afb9622523fdc933c1ddf8bae981dc0f9d6092760cc400b9ea44.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526354}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1e24712f-ed6c-5421-a806-f628b23f4b22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/08/0822ae8783ee9c8c8743ecade2d6404c868d32cc60a2f15fb1d7ba102da88523.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526308} :answer-field/id #uuid "875b585c-cb2a-52e7-a1b4-975ac7f6ecd7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526337}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "5f5eb967-198b-5004-ad32-ecc18e2c0aaa" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}x^{2}-(2)y^{2}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(\\frac{1}{2},- \\frac{3}{2})$,$(\\frac{3}{2},- \\frac{5}{2})$,$(\\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{1}{2},- \\frac{3}{2})}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}-2\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{1}{8}-\\left(\\frac{9}{2}\\right)=- \\frac{35}{8}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{3}{2},- \\frac{5}{2})}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^{2}-2\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{9}{8}-\\left(\\frac{25}{2}\\right)=- \\frac{91}{8}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2})}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{7}{2}\\right)^{2}-2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{49}{8}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{45}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/08/0822ae8783ee9c8c8743ecade2d6404c868d32cc60a2f15fb1d7ba102da88523.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526332 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "552920fa-9e17-5948-be2c-204fe680ad43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/92/927b063e8bf1c0bb3ad79f20bede84a48566252d0c4080ba4d4bce5352354612.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526327} {:answer/id #uuid "753b2745-1b64-538a-9763-ae30c29972bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/2e/2e0a934b40d6ff2955cdbb9d4af2e5bf834ea59c13a212ccd128ffb04f2663e2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526335} {:answer/id #uuid "77337a40-ab33-5f20-86cb-16538f2afbe7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ad/ad671b9846ff1ce2c1b426c44e17d6ae76fb0eaf86fad53a2d42bda69a250513.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526336} {:answer/id #uuid "95cce4b9-092f-59a6-b139-1e95c7565591" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/48/48f33d5ea4edef9614a633a36e3058b7abb4f20381a15d763f348d2edc95cc24.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526340} {:answer/id #uuid "b9933db7-11ed-5b23-8ed2-362d9bba0c9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/49/49f277e08fd14b89c02d197a4b590e37df0d4d601355acf0e4973aa9776db8cb.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526349}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "753b2745-1b64-538a-9763-ae30c29972bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/2e/2e0a934b40d6ff2955cdbb9d4af2e5bf834ea59c13a212ccd128ffb04f2663e2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526335} :answer-field/id #uuid "466bd2ad-f60a-58d0-9a90-bf90c46e62eb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526325}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "6bc94051-032d-5f00-86db-258f754809b7" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{y^{2}}{x}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(- \\frac{5}{2},- \\frac{3}{2})$,$(\\frac{5}{2},- \\frac{5}{2})$,$(\\frac{7}{2},- \\frac{5}{2})$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(- \\frac{5}{2},- \\frac{3}{2})}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)^{2}}{\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{\\frac{9}{4}}{- \\frac{5}{2}}=\\frac{27}{20}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{5}{2},- \\frac{5}{2})}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)^{2}}{\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{\\frac{25}{4}}{\\frac{5}{2}}=- \\frac{15}{4}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(\\frac{7}{2},- \\frac{5}{2})}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right)^{2}}{\\left(\\frac{7}{2}\\right)}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\frac{\\frac{25}{4}}{\\frac{7}{2}}=- \\frac{75}{28}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/2e/2e0a934b40d6ff2955cdbb9d4af2e5bf834ea59c13a212ccd128ffb04f2663e2.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526334 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0cdf06b9-0ec4-5811-a3ae-b9d9e29a16cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/78/783718942621381675559793bcfbffc933a3b475b411da20b577a9ff86c8d220.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526304} {:answer/id #uuid "1f81ed22-0259-5ba8-83a9-3990a9bfb9ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c2/c285ad3d0e1131020ff3a769c7984a65bf64de4b0902821f1db46c8ffab2d3db.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526309} {:answer/id #uuid "2059c211-7671-56cf-beb5-3f860c7789bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f5/f5fa28a440278e54d5d2463c91c494b091e2473430857ebe437196ef1feb1000.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526311} {:answer/id #uuid "99979a10-c07a-56ad-badc-a77e7e0e7788" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/df/df1b5e97bd1a74c6d54f0e7f57b592186336430d6fcc779302d6f5ead9962d7b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526342} {:answer/id #uuid "f33c98fd-0532-5521-8689-d95b9e3629f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/15/1520124880f8f1a1f62b5f32f1d8d279234d3e539bdf1650aced55d25dab7a40.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1f81ed22-0259-5ba8-83a9-3990a9bfb9ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c2/c285ad3d0e1131020ff3a769c7984a65bf64de4b0902821f1db46c8ffab2d3db.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526309} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d4c88c0-dd99-5cae-8049-3bbbefd1e1d9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526333}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "73fbe9c8-3536-5207-91d6-fc946d7384b3" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}-(2)xy?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(-1,-1)$,$(0,3)$,$(1,-1)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-1,-1)}=\\frac{1}{2}-2(-1)(-1)=\\frac{1}{2}-(2)=- \\frac{3}{2}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(0,3)}=\\frac{1}{2}-2(0)(3)=\\frac{1}{2}-(0)=\\frac{1}{2}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(1,-1)}=\\frac{1}{2}-2(1)(-1)=\\frac{1}{2}-(-2)=\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/c2/c285ad3d0e1131020ff3a769c7984a65bf64de4b0902821f1db46c8ffab2d3db.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526341 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06a901d5-ca4f-5737-bade-9a3f95e9fcd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/93/93ca31dd0832f9b09274e8357adfb1b27cefac07efc2ea1fdae1cadff7fa3b69.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526301} {:answer/id #uuid "2c0977f8-8622-51a6-88a6-3fc7164c99ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d8/d8014fb86ea2854bf8184fb5aa805fe0b6d3e1a8261622bbf6f5f619a8ce1ed2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526315} {:answer/id #uuid "4390a21d-ba70-57a9-93e0-edfc65e04c1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/3d/3d41555957cd320f3631109842e318bb713699b0dcebc428f4fd644675c807a2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526324} {:answer/id #uuid "8d4f1112-d5b0-57c6-92ab-ecb8479ec106" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9d/9d155a396810956274ddd882f0936851ff5cb5d8fce675323359f44b77e118d8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526339} {:answer/id #uuid "cd1aa56d-e965-583f-a3e3-be8c7e709980" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/be/bed3530863181b65d9203e422502eabdffeb7edfb9a1d6ceff0f650024825ed5.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526352}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd1aa56d-e965-583f-a3e3-be8c7e709980" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/be/bed3530863181b65d9203e422502eabdffeb7edfb9a1d6ceff0f650024825ed5.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526352} :answer-field/id #uuid "9a818083-44bf-57bd-b9d9-d68d87092f62" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526343}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "997fd844-921f-59ba-966d-0ef1a0054bf4" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)x^{2}-(-2)y^{2}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(- \\frac{1}{2},- \\frac{7}{2})$,$(- \\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$,$(- \\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(- \\frac{1}{2},- \\frac{7}{2})}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}-(-2)\\left(- \\frac{7}{2}\\right)^{2}=- \\frac{3}{8}-\\left(- \\frac{49}{2}\\right)=\\frac{193}{8}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(- \\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2})}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}-(-2)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}=- \\frac{3}{8}-\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{1}{8}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(- \\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2})}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(- \\frac{7}{2}\\right)^{2}-(-2)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}=- \\frac{147}{8}-\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)=- \\frac{143}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/be/bed3530863181b65d9203e422502eabdffeb7edfb9a1d6ceff0f650024825ed5.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526360 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b51aee6-9fa0-57f5-bc0a-956ada38b2b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/76/7614d446d369132f98076b6aa1d0128ca570b62918c41f2eb4d62ffa6b1c7aea.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526303} {:answer/id #uuid "26a07a3a-e60f-5f43-8fe4-a687ab16e462" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/26/26f06483a213fae96c995273ff0ff1e2fd2a735e668d4fbfc3852b79f77f9331.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526313} {:answer/id #uuid "9d4a40d6-5b22-56a0-8d7e-49dc77ab593a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f7/f77d4f1780e4ff74fce5e0303564f38a77968bd2e56390603a9b5b97f03b39a9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526344} {:answer/id #uuid "f2573c4a-1006-56c0-b90a-1c9782cd7914" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/38/38321f6b03143f9dc71efafa9be23d756bc3ae8f44eaaa114b67cff1d5cb7f5b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526362} {:answer/id #uuid "ff291dd9-7e80-5548-8e7c-69c72e8026bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5b/5b40d4c48e2f7d61b67a1777300b39dac72f5455b098d67e95707606a2e427a2.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526367}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9d4a40d6-5b22-56a0-8d7e-49dc77ab593a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f7/f77d4f1780e4ff74fce5e0303564f38a77968bd2e56390603a9b5b97f03b39a9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526344} :answer-field/id #uuid "a6c89f1e-2821-5513-846d-453f92c546d7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526346}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "e6247f84-7d87-51dd-98a1-cd1a03e15bc0" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5}{2}-(3)xy?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(1,-1)$,$(0,-2)$,$(-2,2)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(1,-1)}=\\frac{5}{2}-3(1)(-1)=\\frac{5}{2}-(-3)=\\frac{11}{2}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(0,-2)}=\\frac{5}{2}-3(0)(-2)=\\frac{5}{2}-(0)=\\frac{5}{2}, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,2)}=\\frac{5}{2}-3(-2)(2)=\\frac{5}{2}-(-12)=\\frac{29}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/f7/f77d4f1780e4ff74fce5e0303564f38a77968bd2e56390603a9b5b97f03b39a9.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526361 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "009fad15-5d1a-5691-9dbb-aa0e0c3f2c51" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/92/921545ac305c978db5f35718ddcc60aea6240a4bf0c92e3134649e944bbceeb1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526299} {:answer/id #uuid "027dcc9c-6cc1-5c14-beb5-3f82d7071dd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/bb/bbe64090631ee780d071785a8f97a8870dd2f6557746e2ed7395e9db6e326b48.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526300} {:answer/id #uuid "2e976e20-a065-57ab-8f05-59b325938a8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7a/7a323280b383e42c19701d86c4b005a769ae33539b380fa72e74b117629daac3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526316} {:answer/id #uuid "b632995b-2aa6-549d-a84f-ba75faa988eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/52/527b523863037a491a2adf844ad97a183e26eb76db708d931b1f6baac31c10c7.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526348} {:answer/id #uuid "e51273cd-2b6f-50e1-87c1-939e753b8e95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/ca/ca18948802d9d78a214c7fe1c311b070dd75cb34cf1a86e419a11327dce67c6a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526359}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2e976e20-a065-57ab-8f05-59b325938a8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7a/7a323280b383e42c19701d86c4b005a769ae33539b380fa72e74b117629daac3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526316} :answer-field/id #uuid "368b9ac6-233e-5c72-a838-3c8d9640927d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186526319}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "ec562691-61f7-5234-8201-f633bff4db89" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}x^{2}-(-1)y^{2}?\n$$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(-2,-1)$,$(2,-2)$,$(-1,3)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,-1)}=\\frac{1}{2}(-2)^{2}-(-1)(-1)^{2}=2-(-1)=3, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(2,-2)}=\\frac{1}{2}(2)^{2}-(-1)(-2)^{2}=2-(-4)=6, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-1,3)}=\\frac{1}{2}(-1)^{2}-(-1)(3)^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}-(-9)=\\frac{19}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/7a/7a323280b383e42c19701d86c4b005a769ae33539b380fa72e74b117629daac3.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530581 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51bdb6e8-0d6a-5328-858a-42a6f9dd4e01" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(4 x^{4} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530606} {:answer/id #uuid "6efaa9a4-cab2-5eb2-acfb-4754818a6f65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16 x^{3} \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(4 x^{4} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530615} {:answer/id #uuid "ad98276c-d5c8-5b1d-9026-a3fde7aa4a9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16 x^{3} \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530630} {:answer/id #uuid "af65d9db-1897-5875-8eb6-1b8506282d3a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16 x^{3} \\tan{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530631} {:answer/id #uuid "d47ce2ad-7753-59d6-80e3-da03ceace85d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16 x^{3} \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} - \\left(4 x^{4} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530636}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6efaa9a4-cab2-5eb2-acfb-4754818a6f65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16 x^{3} \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(4 x^{4} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530615} :answer-field/id #uuid "9256250b-c304-500e-91d2-6794e222e1f3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530622}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "00f9082d-0d86-5f9e-9f49-460c209ee39d" :question/problem "Differentiate $(4 x^{4} + 1)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)}).$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=4 x^{4} + 1$ and $v(x)=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}((4 x^{4} + 1)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)}))^{'} & =u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ & =(4 x^{4} + 1)'\\cdot (\\tan{\\left(x \\right)})+(4 x^{4} + 1)\\cdot (\\tan{\\left(x \\right)})' \\\\ & =(16 x^{3})(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)})+(4 x^{4} + 1)(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1) \\\\ & =4 x^{4} \\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 4 x^{4} + 16 x^{3} \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + \\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530582 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87dbb621-b492-5ed9-9fca-744bfb854b9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530619} {:answer/id #uuid "93229879-9f47-5c4c-aab8-5be46908e80a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} - \\left(4 x^{3} + 4\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530623} {:answer/id #uuid "a75e554b-f8ad-5c6e-86e8-d22ddf113264" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(4 x^{3} + 4\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530626} {:answer/id #uuid "e3069c21-faeb-5767-9717-d859d3f3104d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(4 x^{3} + 4\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530642} {:answer/id #uuid "f8223218-07f9-52d1-8b1c-5008ed47e978" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530650}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a75e554b-f8ad-5c6e-86e8-d22ddf113264" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(4 x^{3} + 4\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530626} :answer-field/id #uuid "e319cf66-a95b-5175-8d89-f32277bacd56" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530643}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "014ac4bb-7a72-5e35-b106-ef044de05a7a" :question/problem "Differentiate $(4 x^{3} + 4)(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}).$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=4 x^{3} + 4$ and $v(x)=\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}((4 x^{3} + 4)(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}))^{'} & =u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ & =(4 x^{3} + 4)'\\cdot (\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})+(4 x^{3} + 4)\\cdot (\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})' \\\\ & =(12 x^{2})(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})+(4 x^{3} + 4)(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ & =4 x^{3} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + 12 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 4 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530585 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "26daf466-ef29-5d18-b4d6-0b19055ad7ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(16 x^{3} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\right) + \\left(4 x^{4} + x\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530592} {:answer/id #uuid "42486479-f5a7-5637-948a-c46eceaa8bfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(4 x^{4} + x\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530599} {:answer/id #uuid "4d185028-a8dc-5cf3-b80d-54893105586a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(16 x^{3} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530603} {:answer/id #uuid "8d8e712e-998c-5923-9a65-60879d820f2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(16 x^{3} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530621} {:answer/id #uuid "bd61ff04-8b40-58b9-898f-2e05d4e13a94" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(16 x^{3} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\right) - \\left(4 x^{4} + x\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530633}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "26daf466-ef29-5d18-b4d6-0b19055ad7ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(16 x^{3} + 1\\right) \\left(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\right) + \\left(4 x^{4} + x\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530592} :answer-field/id #uuid "112b676a-b69f-5e1f-83ff-392d7c57da23" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530588}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "08394ee5-3a76-579f-a293-88b55155a354" :question/problem "Differentiate $(4 x^{4} + x)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2).$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=4 x^{4} + x$ and $v(x)=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}((4 x^{4} + x)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2))^{'} & =u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ & =(4 x^{4} + x)'\\cdot (\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2)+(4 x^{4} + x)\\cdot (\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2)' \\\\ & =(16 x^{3} + 1)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2)+(4 x^{4} + x)(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1) \\\\ & =4 x^{4} \\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 4 x^{4} + 16 x^{3} \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 32 x^{3} + x \\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + x + \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 2\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530605 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a80d4dc-bef7-5ff9-88ce-c4c268f75691" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 x \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(4 - x^{2}\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530589} {:answer/id #uuid "29056302-92aa-50a1-b474-327ae7c90b90" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(4 - x^{2}\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530593} {:answer/id #uuid "40a40a5e-3688-5c60-8cac-0f9ff9dc5999" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 x \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530598} {:answer/id #uuid "ac541620-4275-579e-8eae-ccf443e63610" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 x \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} - \\left(4 - x^{2}\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530629} {:answer/id #uuid "f54dde14-0dd0-54c2-aa03-cdb0ea9d9a1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref